(b) within all car parks adjacent to the A_irport buildings; {c) within the areas surrounding the approach lighting at either end of the runway and the adjacent roads;

(d) otherwise all areas within the Airport boundary, with the exception of confines of His Majesty the Sultan's Flight and Royal Brunei Air Force Military Airbase. Exemption. 4. The Director may in his discretion exempt any person or any vehicle from these bye-laws. Penalty. 5. Any person who acts in contravention of or fails to comply with any of these bye-laws or fails to comply with any of the conditions of any airport vehicle permit or airport security passes issued under these byelaws shall be guilty of an offence and shall be liable on conviction to a fine not exceeding $2,000.00 or to imprisonment for a term not exceeding 6 months or both.

